The image is highly relevant to the scientific topic of the PDF, as it is identical to Figure 4 from the Journal of Controlled Release (2015) paper within the provided PDF. It visually demonstrates the core mechanism by which Nano-11 functions as an adjuvant: enhancing antigen delivery to dendritic cells. Specifically, the image shows:
